WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.368
A quiet Kiev

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.803
suburb turned into an inferno.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.973
The sounds of screaming can be heard

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.276
half minutes

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.545
after a helicopter crashed outside

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.747
an apartment building

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:16.082
just steps away from a kindergarten

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.052
on board.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.520
The leadership of Ukraine's

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.022
interior ministry,

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.224
including the minister himself,

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.258
denies modesty.

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.926
Risky and his deputy,

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.795
Jeff Henderson, seen

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:30.096
the chopper was bound

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.731
for the city of Kharkiv

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.266
when it lost control,

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.068
smashing into the kindergarten

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.436
as it descended.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.471
One child was killed.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:39.873
Rescue services work

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.941
to clear the smoldering wreckage

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.010
and search for survivors.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:44.711
His neighbors

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.713
looked out at the scene of horror

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.681
which Alla tells us

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:49.649
she ran outside

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:52.585
as soon as she heard the explosion.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.421
We saw only injured children

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.989
who were on fire.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.824
Sorry she says.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:58.958
They were crying and

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.360
running out from the school.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:02.896
Ukrainian security

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:05.165
services have opened an investigation

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.633
into the crash.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.133
For now,

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.535
there is no suggestion

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:10.603
that foul play was involved.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.806
There was heavy fog in the morning,

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.641
but President Volodymyr

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:15.542
Zelensky said

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:18.178
every death is the result of war.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.014
Even when it is far from the front lines,

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.417
the wife of Deputy Minister

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.319
Jeanine sobbed in shock.

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.354
As she took in the scene.

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:29.823
Another tragedy

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.758
in a nation that has borne witness

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:35.428
to so much horror as daylight faded.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.097
Emergency services

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.731
declared the end of the search

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.100
and rescue,

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:44.471
and the bodies were taken away.

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.141
Now, Wolf, the president, Volodymyr

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.309
Zelensky, said that

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:53.413
rescue operation lasted nearly 9 hours.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:54.747
In addition to the 14

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.049
people who were killed.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.550
I want to stress, 25

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.018
people were injured,

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.420
some of them quite seriously.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.221
We know tonight

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:02.822
that ten people

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:05.325
are being treated at a burn ward

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.128
here in Kiev, and among them

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.130
four children and among the dead.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:12.499
As we mentioned in the story,

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:13.466
one child,

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.668
one young girl was killed world.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:18.571
So truly a tragic day for Ukraine.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:19.139
Right now,

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:20.507
I want to bring in the State

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.675
Department's top spokesperson, Ned Price.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:24.210
He's joining us from the State Department

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:24.611
right now.

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:25.778
Ned, thanks very much

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.780
for joining us on this tragic

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.682
helicopter crash near Kiev.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:30.550
Will the U.S.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.519
be updated on the investigation

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:34.621
into whether this was an accident,

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.022
as it appears to be,

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:38.191
or was it some sort of Russian attack?

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.960
I expect we will, Wolf, and I expect

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.228
we will for a simple reason.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.364
We have been in constant communication

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.832
with our Ukrainian partners

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.834
throughout the course of the day.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.602
Our embassy in Kiev

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:52.438
has been on the line with them virtually

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.706
every hour

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.808
to get an update into this situation.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:56.809
Our embassy in Kiev

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.278
has been in turn providing

00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:00.480
updates back to the department

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.315
here in Washington, D.C..

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.349
The short answer right now

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:04.450
is that we don't know what

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.819
caused this helicopter to go down.

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.421
The Ukrainians have launched

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:09.289
an investigation.

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:10.323
We stand

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.392
ready to assist that investigation.

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:13.760
In any way we can.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:14.661
Our ambassador

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:16.429
and senior officials here in Washington

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:17.297
have made that clear

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:19.032
to our Ukrainian partners.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:20.433
But more than anything else.

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:21.768
What we've made clear

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:23.336
is the sorrow we feel

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:24.470
for the loss of life,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.039
not only for our partner,

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:27.740
the minister of interior

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.442
and members of his team,

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:31.644
but for the dozens of other individuals

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.780
who were killed or wounded in this

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.949
in this tragic crash today.

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:36.382
Our hearts

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.551
go out to those families as well.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:40.453
And then CNN is now reporting

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:41.688
that the United States

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:43.389
the Biden administration is expected

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.190
to announce

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.693
one of the largest military aid packages

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:47.760
to Ukraine.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.262
Yet we're talking about another

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:52.232
$2.5 billion aid package.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.333
It will include

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:54.267
for the first time

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:56.236
Stryker combat vehicles.

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.037
But while a handful of Western allies

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:00.506
want to provide battle tanks, the U.S.

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:02.575
is not expected to provide them,

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:05.044
at least not now. Tell us why. Why not?

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:07.046
Well,

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:07.981
Wolf, on

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.682
any forthcoming announcements, two words,

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:10.650
stay tuned.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.353
As you know, we have made these security

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.287
assistance announcements

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:17.857
at a pretty a good clip over the past

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:20.393
year as this started even before

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:22.829
President Putin's invasion of Ukraine

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:24.497
started on February 24th

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:26.633
at every step of the way.

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:27.634
We have been providing

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:28.801
our Ukrainian partners

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.870
with precisely what they need

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.672
to defend their country,

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:34.440
to defend their sovereignty,

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.542
to defend their territorial integrity

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:38.211
against this brutal land

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:40.380
grab, this territorial war of aggression

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.615
that President Putin has launched.

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:45.418
You use the word reluctance before.

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:45.752
I think

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:47.720
when you look at everything

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.422
the United States has provided

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:51.224
to our Ukrainian partners

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:53.860
over the past year or even longer,

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:55.328
I don't see reluctance, Wolf.

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:56.195
I see determination.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:57.330
I see determination

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.064
to see to it

00:04:58.064 --> 00:04:59.399
that our Ukrainian partners

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.933
have precisely what they need.

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:02.035
You can measure that

00:05:02.035 --> 00:05:04.037
in any number of metrics.

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:06.406
More than $24 billion

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:07.674
of security assistance

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:09.008
since February 24th,

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:11.210
nearly $25 billion

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.513
since the start of this administration.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.815
And at every step of the way,

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.750
as Russia's plans

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.018
have evolved

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:21.287
and as they have failed, each time,

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.323
we too have changed

00:05:23.323 --> 00:05:25.625
the arc of what we have provided

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:26.459
to Ukraine.

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:28.394
When it was about the battle of Kiev

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:29.662
in the earliest hours

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:32.031
and days of President Putin's war,

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:33.199
we provided

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:35.201
stingers and javelins, other air

00:05:35.201 --> 00:05:36.202
defense systems,

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:39.772
other armor, armor, tank vehicles,

00:05:39.772 --> 00:05:41.174
armored vehicles,

00:05:41.174 --> 00:05:43.142
precisely what the Ukrainians needed for

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:43.843
that moment.

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:45.845
As the battle has moved to the east,

00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:48.214
as it's moved to the north, as it is

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:50.583
taken on that flavor, we have provided

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:51.150
high marks,

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.318
longer range systems

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:52.518
that are

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:53.353
Ukrainian partners

00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:54.587
can use to target

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:56.656
Russian positions on their territory.

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:58.791
We have provided a Patriot missile system

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.927
we've provided other air defense systems

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:02.662
that the Ukrainians have used to.

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:04.230
Extraordinary effect,

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.732
even as these Iranian

00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:07.934
produced drones continue to swarm

00:06:08.134 --> 00:06:10.470
into Ukraine's towns and cities.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.505
They the Ukrainians have used the air

00:06:12.505 --> 00:06:14.374
defense systems that we provided

00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:15.108
to shoot down.

00:06:15.108 --> 00:06:15.808
In some cases,

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:18.811
all of these drones now, even one drone,

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:20.546
even one ballistic missile

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:21.781
making its way through this air

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:23.816
defense capability is one too many.

00:06:23.816 --> 00:06:24.650
And we're going to continue

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.952
to provide our Ukrainian partners

00:06:25.952 --> 00:06:27.587
with what they need to defend themselves

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:28.955
and what they need to take back

00:06:28.955 --> 00:06:29.756
the territory

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:30.690
that's been taken from them.

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:31.190
And the U.S.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:31.457
is now

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:32.692
providing the Ukrainians

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:34.293
with Bradley fighting vehicles,

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:35.528
which is very important.

00:06:35.528 --> 00:06:36.829
But they keep appealing.

00:06:36.829 --> 00:06:38.664
President Zaleski keeps appealing

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:39.966
for the M1 Abrams

00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:41.801
battle tanks to be delivered,

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:42.602
and the U.S.

00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:44.070
keeps saying no.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.571
One of the concerns about tanks,

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:47.073
as you know, is logistics.

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:47.907
But the U.S.

00:06:47.907 --> 00:06:50.443
did change its stance on the Patriot Air

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.145
missile air defense system,

00:06:52.145 --> 00:06:53.212
which also requires

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:54.814
extensive training and maintenance.

00:06:54.814 --> 00:06:56.582
Our tanks off the table

00:06:56.582 --> 00:06:59.218
entirely are just off the table for now.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.522
We want to provide our Ukrainian partners

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:04.223
with what they can use

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:06.159
and what they can use effectively

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:07.260
on the battlefield.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.461
As we've demonstrated

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:09.962
before, training is not

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:11.531
an insurmountable obstacle.

00:07:11.531 --> 00:07:12.999
High marks requires training.

00:07:12.999 --> 00:07:14.867
The Patriot system requires training.

00:07:14.867 --> 00:07:16.669
As you mentioned before,

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:18.438
we have provided these Bradley

00:07:18.438 --> 00:07:19.672
fighting vehicles

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:22.875
that provide our Ukrainian partners with

00:07:23.543 --> 00:07:25.044
an asset that they can use

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:25.778
on the ground

00:07:25.778 --> 00:07:27.947
to take on Russian positions

00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:29.182
in the near term.

00:07:29.182 --> 00:07:30.950
But what we don't want to do

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.019
is to saddle our Ukrainian partners

00:07:33.019 --> 00:07:34.153
with systems

00:07:34.153 --> 00:07:36.856
that they won't be able to use, systems

00:07:36.856 --> 00:07:37.690
that they won't be able

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.825
to repair, systems

00:07:38.825 --> 00:07:41.360
that they won't be able to refurbish.

00:07:41.561 --> 00:07:43.629
Every armored vehicle

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:44.897
that you've heard about

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:46.966
has its own characteristics

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:49.168
The M1 Abrams is different

00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:51.103
from what other countries have

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:51.904
in their possession.

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:53.005
It's different from the Bradley

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:54.040
fighting vehicle

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.341
that we have in our possession.

00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:56.943
We are focused on providing

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.244
our Ukrainian partners

00:07:58.244 --> 00:07:58.911
with what

00:07:58.911 --> 00:08:00.213
they can put to use,

00:08:00.213 --> 00:08:03.115
if not immediately, in the very near term

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:05.251
and what they can continue to use

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:06.819
for the foreseeable future.

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:08.554
To see to it that

00:08:08.554 --> 00:08:09.922
the assistance we're providing

00:08:09.922 --> 00:08:11.691
has the utmost effect on the battlefield.

